      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds really intense. i like the phrasing. \n\nnow, we need to address the people who are gonna fight this. like, obviously the current billionaires and corporations are gonna say this is basically stealing or whatever. how should the manifesto frame them? i want it to sound like their argument isn't just wrong, but actually part of the problem that's killing us.",
